From f4d50fddb29b83af060a326b4cd30efb88d1350b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sachin <sachinbarange86@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 13:48:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Update launcher icon to HyperOS 4 (port of upstream 0011)

Upstream 0011 swapped the stock onyx camera launcher icon for the HyperOS 4
artwork. The stock dump calls the icon "etk", the dyper dump calls it "etj",
so the port is a rename-level mapping plus re-pinning the two new resource ids.

Artwork taken from the already-patched stock APK
(android_vendor_xiaomi_onyx-miuicamera/proprietary/system/priv-app/MiuiCamera/MiuiCamera.apk),
not decoded from the upstream .patch, so the bytes are exactly what the ROM
camera ships.

  res/mipmap-anydpi/etj.xml          rewritten (was: @color/etj_bg + @drawable/etj_mn)
  res/mipmap-{x,xx,xxx}hdpi/etj_fg.png    <- etk_fg.png   (camera body + blue lens)
  res/mipmap-{x,xx,xxx}hdpi/etj_bg.png    <- etk_bg.png   (light grey gradient, NEW)
  res/mipmap-xxxhdpi/etj_mono.png         <- etk_mono.png (themed-icon layer, NEW)

res/values/public.xml gains the two new mipmap ids (the type only held
etj=0x7f110000 and etj_fg=0x7f110001, so 0x7f110002/0x7f110003 are free):

  <public type="mipmap" name="etj_bg"   id="0x7f110002" />
  <public type="mipmap" name="etj_mono" id="0x7f110003" />

color/etj_bg (#ffffff) and drawable/etj_mn are now unreferenced but left in
place - they are pinned in public.xml and deleting them would risk shifting
other resource ids for no gain.

Unlike upstream this tree has no res/mipmap-anydpi-v26/ variant; the single
unqualified mipmap-anydpi/etj.xml is what the platform resolves on API 26+, so
only one file is rewritten.

Signed-off-by: Sachin <sachinbarange86@gmail.com>
---
 res/mipmap-anydpi/etj.xml       |   7 +++----
 res/mipmap-xhdpi/etj_bg.png     | Bin 0 -> 1089 bytes
 res/mipmap-xhdpi/etj_fg.png     | Bin 22002 -> 3890 bytes
 res/mipmap-xxhdpi/etj_bg.png    | Bin 0 -> 1089 bytes
 res/mipmap-xxhdpi/etj_fg.png    | Bin 40476 -> 3890 bytes
 res/mipmap-xxxhdpi/etj_bg.png   | Bin 0 -> 8986 bytes
 res/mipmap-xxxhdpi/etj_fg.png   | Bin 64742 -> 161555 bytes
 res/mipmap-xxxhdpi/etj_mono.png | Bin 0 -> 23456 bytes
 res/values/public.xml           |   2 ++
 9 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 res/mipmap-xhdpi/etj_bg.png
 create mode 100644 res/mipmap-xxhdpi/etj_bg.png
 create mode 100644 res/mipmap-xxxhdpi/etj_bg.png
 create mode 100644 res/mipmap-xxxhdpi/etj_mono.png

diff --git a/res/mipmap-anydpi/etj.xml b/res/mipmap-anydpi/etj.xml
index b3e20d97..c124e776 100644
--- a/res/mipmap-anydpi/etj.xml
+++ b/res/mipmap-anydpi/etj.xml
@@ -1,7 +1,6 @@
 <?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
-<adaptive-icon
-  xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android">
-    <background android:drawable="@color/etj_bg" />
+<adaptive-icon xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android">
+    <background android:drawable="@mipmap/etj_bg" />
     <foreground android:drawable="@mipmap/etj_fg" />
-    <monochrome android:drawable="@drawable/etj_mn" />
+    <monochrome android:drawable="@mipmap/etj_mono" />
 </adaptive-icon>
